  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">You can transform into a powerful creature by drawing upon its anima from your maelstrom. You enter an Anima Transformation and turn into a creature listed in the Anima Morph of an anima spell you have prepared. This transformation lasts for 1 minute.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Special</span> If you are of the Morpher anima manifestation, when you take this action, you can use Synergism instead; when you do, you transform with one action.</p>"
